text":"So this isn't the notes section,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_26","text":"but a chat room? With you in it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_27","text":"It appears so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_28","text":"I'm sorry, Superhuman.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_29","text":"I should have double-checked before writing things down here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_30","text":"No, Anis and Neon are the ones to blame here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_31","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_32","text":"Is it okay if I keep writing down memos here?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_33","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_34","text":"I'm often forgetting all sorts of little things.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_35","text":"That's why I need to take notes in the first place.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_36","text":"The only thing is there's never a proper place for me to take them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_37","text":"Do you not have a note app on your phone? Or a paper notebook?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_38","text":"I'm more comfortable writing things here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_39","text":"It gives me a sense of stability,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_40","text":"and I seem to remember things better.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_41","text":"Does it bother you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_42","text":"If it does, I'll stop.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_43","text":"No, no, it's fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_44","text":"Is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_45","text":"Thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_46","text":"Hand mirror.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_47","text":"Comb.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_48","text":"Battery.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_grave_02_49","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_grave_02_49","text":"For the sake of convenience, I'll let Grave keep using this for her notes.","jump":null}],"chat":true}